 20 districts are  having 20 plus uh infection rate in the  country  and it is coming back to taka also  it is increasing in dhaka so overall  situation is  is alarming the government has deployed  the army along with border guards and  other security forces  to enforce a strict shutdown in phases  starting on monday  many health officials have been critical  of its recent handling of the pandemic  which has been fueled by the delta  variant now they worry  the situation could get worse if the new  measures are not properly enforced  sandwich al jazeera mawa bangladesh
 

